the index pipeline:


RAW DATA
   │
   ▼
┌──────────┐
│  LOAD    │  ← Document Loaders
└──────────┘
   │  Documents
   ▼
┌──────────┐
│  SPLIT   │  ← Text Splitters
└──────────┘
   │  Chunks
   ▼
┌──────────┐
│  EMBED   │  ← Embedding Model
└──────────┘
   │  Vectors
   ▼
┌──────────┐
│  STORE   │  ← Vector Store + Index
└──────────┘
   │
   ▼
SEARCHABLE INDEX  ← ready for queries






